      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n&#39; --- HORIZONTALE COMPACT-EINSTELLUNGEN FÜR DIN A4 ---\nskinparam maxMessageSize 130\nskinparam BoxPadding 3\nskinparam ParticipantPadding 5\nskinparam FontSize 11\nskinparam ArrowFontSize 10\n\ntitle Kategorie: Projekte / Sandbox (DIN A4)\n\nautonumber\nactor Client\nparticipant \&quot;Next.js API\&quot; as API\nparticipant \&quot;Sandbox Logic\&quot; as Logic\ndatabase PostgreSQL as DB\n\n== 1. Projekte listen (GET /api/sandbox/list) ==\nClient -&gt; API : GET /api/sandbox/list\nAPI -&gt; Logic : getListOfSandboxProjects()\nLogic -&gt; DB : SELECT FROM Project\\nLEFT JOIN ProjectRelation\nDB --&gt; Logic : Projekte mit experts[]\nLogic --&gt; API : projects[]\nAPI --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, projects }\n\n== 2. Projekt erstellen (POST /api/sandbox/add) ==\nClient -&gt; API : POST /api/sandbox/add\\n{ title, state, ... }\nalt Pflichtfelder fehlen\n    API --&gt; Client : 400 Bad Request\nelse Validierung OK\n    API -&gt; Logic : addProject(body)\n    Logic -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO Project\n    DB --&gt; Logic : projectId\n    opt RACI-Rollen zugewiesen\n        Logic -&gt; DB : INSERT INTO ProjectRelation\n    end\n    Logic --&gt; API : projectId\n    API --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, projectId }\nend\n\n== 3. Projekt aktualisieren (PATCH /api/sandbox/update) ==\nClient -&gt; API : PATCH /api/sandbox/update\\n{ project_id, ... }\nalt project_id fehlt\n    API --&gt; Client : 400 Bad Request\nelse Validierung OK\n    API -&gt; Logic : updateProject(id, body)\n    Logic -&gt; DB : UPDATE Project\n    opt RACI-Zuordnungen update\n        Logic -&gt; DB : UPDATE ProjectRelation\n    end\n    DB --&gt; Logic : Status\n    alt Projekt nicht gefunden\n        Logic --&gt; API : null\n        API --&gt; Client : 404 Not Found\n    else Update erfolgreich\n        Logic --&gt; API : projectId\n        API --&gt; Client : 200 OK { success, projectId }\n    end\nend\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="UBk01s_a_QuDmtHOnqj0-64">
